  "faqWhatIsPatiTakip": "What is PatiTakip?",
  "faqWhatIsPatiTakipAnswer": "PatiTakip is a comprehensive mobile app designed to make pet care easier. It offers vaccination tracking, daily notes, and AI-powered chat features.",
  "faqHowToAddPet": "How do I add a pet?",
  "faqHowToAddPetAnswer": "You can add a new pet by clicking the + button on the main page. You need to enter basic information such as pet type, breed, gender, and birth date.",
  "faqHowToTrackVaccines": "How do I track vaccinations?",
  "faqHowToTrackVaccinesAnswer": "Go to the 'Vaccines' tab on the pet detail page to add new vaccines or view existing ones. You can mark completed vaccines as done.",
  "faqHowToUseAI": "How do I use the AI chat feature?",
  "faqHowToUseAIAnswer": "Click the AI button in the bottom right corner of the main page to chat with artificial intelligence. You can ask questions in writing.",
  "faqVoiceCommands": "How do voice commands work?",
  "faqVoiceCommandsAnswer": "Press the microphone button on the AI chat page to ask questions by voice. The app converts your voice to text and AI responds.",
  "faqNotifications": "How do I set up notifications?",
  "faqNotificationsAnswer": "You can manage your notification preferences in Settings > Notifications. You can receive notifications for vaccination times.",
  "faqDataBackup": "Is my data safe?",
  "faqDataBackupAnswer": "Yes, all your data is stored securely on Firebase cloud servers. Your data is always accessible when you log into your account.",
  "faqMultiplePets": "Can I add multiple pets?",
  "faqMultiplePetsAnswer": "Yes, you can add as many pets as you want. Each pet has its own profile and tracking system.",
  "faqShareAccount": "Can I share my account with others?",
  "faqShareAccountAnswer": "Yes, you can add other users from the 'Co-owner Management' section on the pet detail page. This way family members can also participate in pet care.",
  "faqAppUpdates": "How do app updates work?",
  "faqAppUpdatesAnswer": "You can set up automatic update settings in Settings > Update. New features and improvements are added regularly.",
  "faqContactSupport": "How can I contact the support team?",
  "faqContactSupportAnswer": "You can contact our support team using the 'Send Feedback' section on this page or by sending an email directly.",
  "faqPrivacyPolicy": "What is the privacy policy?",
  "faqPrivacyPolicyAnswer": "Your personal data is securely protected and not shared with third parties. Our privacy policy is available on our website.",
  "faqTermsOfService": "What are the terms of service?",
  "faqTermsOfServiceAnswer": "By using the app, you accept our terms of service. You can find the full text on our website.",
  "faqAppFree": "Is the app free?",
  "faqAppFreeAnswer": "Yes, PatiTakip is completely free. All basic features are available to everyone.",
  "faqDeviceSupport": "Which devices does it work on?",
  "faqDeviceSupportAnswer": "PatiTakip currently only works on Android devices.",
  "faqMultiUserSupport": "How does multi-user support work?",
  "faqMultiUserSupportAnswer": "You can add other users from the 'Co-owner Management' section on the pet detail page. This way family members can also participate in pet care and access the same information.",
  "faqDataSecurity": "Is my data secure?",
  "faqDataSecurityAnswer": "Yes, all your data is stored securely on Firebase cloud servers with encryption. Your data is always accessible when you log into your account.",
  "faqPetWeight": "Can I track my pet's weight?",
  "faqPetWeightAnswer": "Yes, you can record your pet's weight in notes. This way you can track weight changes and monitor health status.",
  "faqVetAppointments": "Can I track vet appointments?",
  "faqVetAppointmentsAnswer": "Yes, you can record vet appointments in notes.",
  "faqPetSleep": "Can I track my pet's sleep schedule?",
  "faqPetSleepAnswer": "Yes, you can record your pet's sleep schedule in notes. You can take notes about sleep duration and quality.",
  "faqPetSocial": "How can I record social activities?",
  "faqPetSocialAnswer": "You can record your pet's playtime with other animals, park visits, and social activities in notes.",
  "faqVaccineRequirements": "Can I get information about vaccine requirements in different countries?",
  "faqVaccineRequirementsAnswer": "You can get general information using the AI chat feature, but we always recommend checking official veterinary sources.",
  "faqOfflineUse": "Can I use the app without internet connection?",
  "faqOfflineUseAnswer": "Basic features work limitedly offline, but internet connection is required for data synchronization and AI chat.",
  "faqDataExport": "Can I export my data?",
  "faqDataExportAnswer": "No, data export feature is not currently available.",
  "faqAppSize": "How much space does the app take?",
  "faqAppSizeAnswer": "PatiTakip takes approximately 50-100 MB. Photos are stored in the cloud so they don't take much space on your device.",
  "faqBugReport": "How can I send a bug report?",
  "faqBugReportAnswer": "You can send bug reports using the 'Feedback' section in the app. If you provide detailed descriptions, we can help you faster.",
  "faqFeatureRequest": "How can I suggest features?",
  "faqFeatureRequestAnswer": "You can send new feature suggestions through the 'Feedback' section. All suggestions are evaluated and the most popular ones are developed.",
  "faqCommunityForum": "Is there a community forum?",
  "faqCommunityForumAnswer": "Yes, a community forum for PatiTakip users will open soon. You can share your experiences and get advice from other users there.",
  "faqPetHealth": "How can I track my pet's health?",
  "faqPetHealthAnswer": "You can track your pet's health by monitoring their daily activities, setting vaccination reminders, and recording veterinary visits in the app.",
  "faqPetPhotos": "Can I add photos to my pet's profile?",
  "faqPetPhotosAnswer": "Yes, you can add multiple photos to your pet's profile and update them anytime to keep track of their growth and changes.",
  "faqPetNotes": "How do I add notes about my pet?",
  "faqPetNotesAnswer": "You can add text, voice, and visual notes about your pet's behavior, health, or special moments using the note features in the app.",
  "faqPetReminders": "Can I set reminders for pet care?",
  "faqPetRemindersAnswer": "Yes, you can set reminders for vaccinations, vet appointments, grooming, feeding, and other important pet care activities.",
  "faqPetTraining": "Does the app help with pet training?",
  "faqPetTrainingAnswer": "The AI assistant can provide training tips and advice, but for complex training issues, we recommend consulting with a professional trainer.",
  "faqPetEmergency": "What should I do in a pet emergency?",
  "faqPetEmergencyAnswer": "In case of emergency, contact your veterinarian immediately. The app can help you keep emergency contact information easily accessible.",
  "faqPetTravel": "How can I prepare my pet for travel?",
  "faqPetTravelAnswer": "The app can help you prepare travel checklists, ensure vaccinations are up to date, and keep important documents organized.",
  "faqPetGrooming": "How often should I groom my pet?",
  "faqPetGroomingAnswer": "Grooming frequency depends on your pet's breed, coat type, and lifestyle. The AI assistant can provide specific recommendations for your pet.",
  "faqPetExercise": "How much exercise does my pet need?",
  "faqPetExerciseAnswer": "Exercise needs vary by breed, age, and health. The app can help you create personalized exercise plans and track activity levels.",
  "faqPetDiet": "What should I feed my pet?",
  "faqPetDietAnswer": "Diet recommendations depend on your pet's age, breed, health, and activity level. Consult with your veterinarian for personalized nutrition advice.",
